{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "That is it from this game! But the action does not stop here as we now move to Abu Dhabi where Sri Lanka will face West Indies. That game will begin at 6 pm local (2 pm GMT). We hope to see you there! Cheers.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:32:40+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Aaron Finch, the skipper of Australia,\u00a0says that it was a clinical performance and credits the bowlers for the way they started things off. Adds that the coaches did have a conversation about NRR before the game but the players concentrated on the game. Informs that they were aware at the halfway mark of what they needed to do to go over South Africa in terms of NRR. Says that the break after the game against England was a good one and it is good to be back to winning ways.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:32:33+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "The Bangladesh skipper, Mahmudullah, says it is difficult to comment after such performances. Mentions that\u00a0they have a lot of things to work on especially the batting. They will have a chat back home about the same. Adds that\u00a0it is the Powerplay that is crucial in T20 matches but they did not make the most of it in their\u00a0campaign. Goes on to say that\u00a0in the Super 12 they got close against Sri Lanka and West Indies, while in the remaining games they were outplayed by the oppositions. Ends by saying, he just wants the fans to back them until the next time.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:32:23+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Adam Zampa\u00a0is the Player of the Match. He\u00a0says it been a while he has been playing cricket for Australia and the five-wicket haul has always eluded him, but he is glad to achieve it finally. Also, says Wade has been really good during the whole tournament and has helped him a lot with wickets. Adds he is upset about missing out on the Hat Trick but is very happy about the win above anything.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:27:03+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "... Stay tuned for the presentation ...", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:30:49+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Earlier in the day, Australia bundled out Bangladesh for just 73, courtesy of some exceptional bowling performance and they chased it down with utmost ease to stay in the semi-final race. They now move above South Africa in the points table and it was just the kind of game Aaron Finch\u00a0and his men were hoping for going ahead in this competition.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:26:15+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Well, Australia made a mockery of this chase and it was just a walk in the park for Aussie batters in the end. Aaron Finch and David Warner came out all guns blazing and they were in a hurry to finish off the game quickly in order to better their Net Run Rate. They got off to a flier and both of them fell when they were only few runs behind the target. Mitchell Marsh came in at number 3 and he smashed it to all parts of the ground. In the end, Australia won the game by 8 wickets, and most importantly with 82 balls to spare.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:32:10+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Bangladesh's bowlers had only 73 runs to play with and the intent with which the Aussie openers came in to bat made things even more difficult for them. Mustafizur Rahman was taken to the cleaners and it was only Taskin Ahmed who troubled the Aussie openers a bit. He did get rid of Aaron Finch but the damage had already been done. Shoriful Islam came in late to bowl and sent back Warner.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:22:06+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "This has been an extremely dominant performance from Australia and they are back to winning ways after suffering a thumping defeat against England. To add to this, Australia also go above South Africa in the points table, courtesy of better NRR and they will be extremely pleased with this result. Bangladesh, however, will take their flight back home as they stay winless at the end of their Super 12 stage.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:14:29+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,331,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Bowler_Name": "Taskin Ahmed", "Batsman": "10094", "Batsman_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "SIX! BANG! Mitchell Marsh\u00a0finishes things off in style. Slightly short, around off. Marsh stays inside the crease and smokes it over the mid-wicket fence for a maximum. AUSTRALIA WINS THE GAME BY 8 WICKETS.", "Summary": {"Score": "78/2", "Over": "6.2", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10094", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "16", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "10085", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "58314", "Overs": "3.2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "36", "Wickets": "1", "Ball_bowled": "20", "Dot_balls": "8"}], "Balls": "38"}, "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:12:38+00:00", "Non_Striker": "10085", "Non_Striker_Name": "Glenn Maxwell", "Score": "78/2", "Batsman_Runs": "6", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "6", "Ball_Speed": "143.0kph", "Ball_Number": "38", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Bowler_Name": "Taskin Ahmed", "Batsman": "10094", "Batsman_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "WIDE! Bouncer and on off. The ball goes way above the batter's head. The umpire signals it as a wide.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:11:58+00:00", "Non_Striker": "10085", "Non_Striker_Name": "Glenn Maxwell", "Score": "72/2", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Extras_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "143.0kph", "Ball_Number": "38", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,219,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Bowler_Name": "Taskin Ahmed", "Batsman": "10094", "Batsman_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "FOUR! Nicely played! Up and over! A length ball, on off. Marsh stays back and lifts it over mid off. The ball races away to the fence.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:10:59+00:00", "Non_Striker": "10085", "Non_Striker_Name": "Glenn Maxwell", "Score": "71/2", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "4", "Ball_Speed": "143.0kph", "Ball_Number": "37", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Glenn Maxwell\u00a0walks out to bat.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:09:43+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66332", "Bowler_Name": "Shoriful Islam", "Batsman": "5380", "Batsman_Name": "David Warner", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "OUT! BOWLED! Shoriful Islam\u00a0now finds success on\u00a0the last ball of his first over. Warner looks to go for a biggie but misses the ball completely. A length ball, around middle and off. Warner looks to heave it across the line but misses. The ball goes through to castle the stumps.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "5380", "Summary": {"Score": "67/2", "Over": "6", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "5380", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "18", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10094", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66332", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "1", "Ball_bowled": "6", "Dot_balls": "1"}], "Balls": "36"}, "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:09:27+00:00", "Non_Striker": "10094", "Non_Striker_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Score": "67/2", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Dismissal_Type": "bowled", "Dismissal_Id": "b", "Ball_Speed": "134.0kph", "Howout": "b Shoriful Islam", "Fielders": [], "Ball_Number": "36", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,181,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66332", "Bowler_Name": "Shoriful Islam", "Batsman": "10094", "Batsman_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "A length ball, around off. Marsh punches it to cover for a single.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:08:15+00:00", "Non_Striker": "5380", "Non_Striker_Name": "David Warner", "Score": "67/1", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "138.0kph", "Ball_Number": "35", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,283,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66332", "Bowler_Name": "Shoriful Islam", "Batsman": "5380", "Batsman_Name": "David Warner", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "Warner could not make the most of the Free Hit. Full, around middle and leg. Warner comes down the track and nudges it towards mid on for a single.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:07:49+00:00", "Non_Striker": "10094", "Non_Striker_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Score": "66/1", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "133.0kph", "Ball_Number": "34", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,336,3", "Detail": "nb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66332", "Bowler_Name": "Shoriful Islam", "Batsman": "5380", "Batsman_Name": "David Warner", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "NO BALL! Back of a length, around off. Warner pulls it to mid-wicket off the inner half. The bowler has overstepped and the umpire has given a no ball. Free Hit to follow.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:07:14+00:00", "Non_Striker": "10094", "Non_Striker_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Score": "65/1", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Extras_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "132.0kph", "Ball_Number": "34", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,190,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66332", "Bowler_Name": "Shoriful Islam", "Batsman": "10094", "Batsman_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Good length and on off. Marsh taps it to cover and crosses for a single.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:06:23+00:00", "Non_Striker": "5380", "Non_Striker_Name": "David Warner", "Score": "64/1", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "137.0kph", "Ball_Number": "33", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,345,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66332", "Bowler_Name": "Shoriful Islam", "Batsman": "10094", "Batsman_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "FOUR! There you go. Marsh gets off the mark with a boundary. A length ball, on off. Marsh stays back and pulls it through mid-wicket for a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:05:42+00:00", "Non_Striker": "5380", "Non_Striker_Name": "David Warner", "Score": "63/1", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "4", "Ball_Speed": "136.0kph", "Ball_Number": "32", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,309,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66332", "Bowler_Name": "Shoriful Islam", "Batsman": "5380", "Batsman_Name": "David Warner", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "A length ball, on off. David Warner\u00a0pushes it to mid off for a single.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:05:01+00:00", "Non_Striker": "10094", "Non_Striker_Name": "Mitchell Marsh", "Score": "59/1", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "122.0kph", "Ball_Number": "31", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Who will Australia\u00a0send in now? Glenn Maxwell? Marcus Stoinis? Nope, they stick with Mitchell Marsh. Also, Shoriful Islam\u00a0comes on now.", "Timestamp": "2021-11-04T12:04:43+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Bowler_Name": "Taskin Ahmed", "Batsman": "4196", "Batsman_Name": "Aaron Finch", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "OUT! TIMBER! Taskin Ahmed\u00a0has the last laugh here. Finch departs after an impressive knock of 40 runs, but he could not end things here. On a length, on the off pole. Finch makes room and looks to punch it through the off side but misses. The ball goes through to castle the stumps. Consolation wicket for Bangladesh here.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "4196", "Summary": {"Scor